    "App Store Connect → Users and Access → Integrations → App Store Connect API → Team Keys. Create a key with the Developer role and download the .p8 file (Apple lets you download it only once). Free.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "fa-AF": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App Store Connect ← Users and Access ← Integrations ← App Store Connect API ← Team Keys. یک کلید با نقش Developer بسازید و فایل ‎.p8 را دانلود کنید (Apple فقط یک بار اجازهٔ دانلود می‌دهد). رایگان است."
          }
        }
      }
    },
